Sephetho ngola: ['Test object'], mola-o-mocha.
>> a := Ntho ncha. 

a ha-ho-fihla: ['item:'] etsa: { :num
	ea-hao num := num. 
}.

a ha-ho-fihla: ['item'] etsa: { <- ea-hao num.
}.

a item: 123.

Sephetho ngola: a item, mola-o-mocha.

>> old-num-address := a item mohlala-oa-pele aterese-ea-mohopolo.
a save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
